  "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
  "label": "User projected onto the woman in the kitchen as the embodiment of domestic sacrifice",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the visual material of the woman_in_kitchen, who is depicted as the representative of women who sacrificed for the 'comfortable home'. This projection is implicit, as the meme frames her domestic role as the ultimate sacrifice, inviting the user to identify with or see themselves as part of this trope. The user is not explicitly addressed with deictic pronouns like 'you' or 'me', but the visual and textual framing positions the viewer to interpret the woman_in_kitchen as the subject of the sacrifice narrative, thereby projecting the user's identity onto her as the 'comfortable home' caretaker.",
